{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1209527-tribes-initiation-challenges","id":1209527,"title":"Tribes initiation challenges","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-20T23:40:00-07:00","id":1209527,"title":"Tribes initiation challenges","content":"What challenges would Firstborn put forth new Forsaken applicants to Tribe? To start discussion \u2013 I look for the Hunters in Darkness initiation, as one of players want to join them in already running game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T01:45:04-07:00","id":1209559,"title":"","content":"I imagine something related to the tribal Ban, so... guard a designated area from trespassers and interlopers for a given period of time?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T05:17:08-07:00","id":1209585,"title":"","content":"Maybe something more direct? I would want to use this challange as a way for Gathra for the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1209584-are-there-secondborn\">'Secondborn'</a> of Hunters in Darkness Tribe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-22-2018, 01:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T16:59:41-07:00","id":1209820,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2653_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2653\" data-vbnamecard=\"2653\">NateD</a> has one in his <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?785380-Werewolf-the-Forsaken-Home-Is-Where-The-Bones-Are&amp;p=21383040#post21383040\" target=\"_blank\">Actual Play</a> for Bone Shadows, for an example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T08:19:15-07:00","id":1210031,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:13px\">Of all possible Ordeals, the werewolves who wish </span>to be bound to Black Wolf must usually perform either a \u201cstalking hunt\u201d or a \u201chiding hunt.\u201d In the case of the former, the Ghost Wolf is the hunter. In the latter, the werewolf is the prey. Success in either of these hunting styles assures entry into the tribe; it need not be both. Stalking hunts often involve the ritemaster bargaining with a minor spirit ally in advance, and ordering the Gaffling to hide from the cub until sunrise. The spirit might feasibly hide anywhere in the local Shadow, and may even change hiding places more than once, leading the werewolf on a long and difficult hunt. If the werewolf manages to track the spirit before the sun shows his face with the dawn, then it is a success. Other variations on the stalking hunt include seeking a minor fetish hidden somewhere in unfamiliar territory, or tracking down each member of his pack-to-be in an allotted time. Hiding hunts are tense affairs. On these, it is the<br /> <span style=\"font-size:13px\">Ghost Wolf who hides from either the ritemaster, the </span>ritemaster\u2019s spirit allies and, sometimes, even the pack he wishes to join. He must stay unseen (or at the very least, uncaught) until the next night. If the werewolf manages to stay hidden for the entire night and the following day, he returns to the ritemaster and declares his success. If he has failed and been discovered, then it is down to Hikaon herself to decide just how skillful the Ghost Wolf was and whether she will accept him.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:13px\">After the Ordeal comes the Oath of the Moon, sworn </span>in addition to Black Wolf\u2019s own tenet: Let No Sacred Place in Your Territory Be Violated. Though Hikaon is renowned for placing a great deal of her potential favor on the outcome of the Ordeal, it is also said she can read the hearts of her adopted children and may turn down a werewolf who does not truly hold fast to the Oath he swears. If she believes he is paying lip service to her own tenet, she will not allow him to join the Hunters in Darkness. Many ritemasters instruct the Ghost Wolf to explain at length why he believes Black Wolf\u2019s tenet to be the most important addition to the Oath of the Moon. This part of the rite is often referred to as the Final Vow.<br /> <br /> -1e Stuff<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-13T03:43:49-07:00","id":1218165,"title":"","content":"So coming closer to the game session about Hunters in Darkness initiation I have another problem. This scene would be critical to the relation with Shadow Wolf, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1209584-are-there-secondborn\">Secondborn</a> I prepare for the game - and PCs want to use in their longer plan in the chronicle. As this will be important scene for only one PC - and being it Stalking Hunt - it will take a game time. Probably A LOT of game time - which we have very limited in this group session ). ( Probably most of this game session. )<br /> <br /> <b>I simply wonder if Secondborn will be okay if whole hunting Pack would help the Tribe initiate?</b> He still will find the Prey - he only will have support of his closes Pack. In the end, it's Hunters in Darkness supplicant that makes Oath of the Moon at the end, binding the bond with Tribe's Totem, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-14-2018, 02:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-13T15:28:30-07:00","id":1218349,"title":"","content":"If you want them to be ok with it then do it that way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}